<h2>🔗 Check a Link</h2>
<p>Check URL formatting and a few suspicious patterns.
No live threat database is connected yet.</p>
<input id="url" type="text" placeholder="https://example.com">
<button class="primary" onclick="checkLink()">Inspect Link</button>
<div id="urlResult" class="result hidden" aria-live="polite"></div>
</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>🆘 I've Been Scammed</h2>
<p>If you think you have been scammed, start with these steps:</p>
<label><input type="checkbox"> Contact your bank or payment provider through its official channel if money was sent.</label>
<label><input type="checkbox"> Change compromised passwords using a trusted device.</label>
<label><input type="checkbox"> Secure affected accounts and enable multi-factor authentication.</label>
<label><input type="checkbox"> Save messages, receipts, transaction IDs and timestamps.</label>
<label><input type="checkbox"> Report the incident to the relevant platform and official authorities.</label>
<p><strong>Warning:</strong> Do not pay strangers who promise guaranteed recovery of lost money.</p>
</section>

